#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_card_view
msgid ""
"\n"
"Modern product list card view (masonry) for foreign trade SOHO scenarios.\n"
"\n"
"Source language: English (en_US); Simplified Chinese translation in "
"i18n/zh_CN.po.\n"
"\n"
"Features:\n"
"- Adds a \"Card\" entry to the official Products view switcher (Inventory / "
"Sales / Purchase)\n"
"- Card with main image carousel (arrows + swipe), title, reference, on "
"hand\n"
"- Multi-image sources follow product_image (template + per-variant, never "
"mixed)\n"
"- Variant switcher on the card for multi-variant products\n"
"- Masonry (waterfall) responsive multi-column layout\n"
"\n"
"Optional integrations:\n"
"- product_image: enables the multi-image gallery; without it only the main "
"image shows\n"
"- sale / purchase: Card is injected into their Products actions only when "
"installed\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"外贸 SOHO 场景下的现代化产品列表卡片视图（瀑布流）。\n"
"\n"
"源语言为英文（en_US），简体中文译文见 i18n/zh_CN.po。\n"
"\n"
"功能：\n"
"- 为官方 Products 视图切换器新增「Card」入口（库存 / 销售 / 采购）\n"
"- 卡片包含主图轮播（左右箭头 + 滑动）、标题、参考号与在手数量\n"
"- 多图图源跟随 product_image（模板 + 变体两层，互不叠加）\n"
"- 多变体产品可在卡片上切换变体\n"
"- 瀑布流（masonry）响应式多列布局\n"
"\n"
"可选集成：\n"
"- product_image：启用多图图库；未安装时只显示主图\n"
"- sale / purchase：仅在安装后才把 Card 注入其 Products 动作\n"

